            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Bumps on the screen you use

FIXED
Bump arrivals now appear on your main display by default, even if your MacBook has a notch. Choose a different display in Settings > General.

The Bump island no longer waits for the macOS notification permission prompt, and Firstlight checks for new arrivals when you return to the app.
]]></description>
