            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Agent activity uses less disk

IMPROVED
Firstlight now groups agent activity scans and avoids saving unchanged scan state. This reduces disk writes during long agent sessions.
]]></description>
